-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",30,{
[929]="7006C531\n1\tCollect craban eyes from the wastes of Khûd Zagin ([see journal]/10)\tZidek asks that you head into the wild where the crebain used by the Ordâkhai roam freely to slaughter the birds and steal their eyes. He believes if the proper sacrifice is made, his sight will return.\n2\tReturn the craban eyes to Zidek at Jirush\tYou slaughtered many of the crebain and collected their eyes. Return to Jirush, in central Khûd Zagin, and deliver them to Zidek as he listens to Zidemel preach in Jirush.\n",
[930]="7002CE2B\n1\tCollect large venom-glands (total: 4)\030Collect bloated venom-glands (total: 2)\030Collect glowing venom-glands (total: 3)\tErymeldir has asked you and your allies to try to retrieve some poison-glands from the wandering spiders hunting the northern stretch of the Limlight Gorge, in the hopes of identifying the venom that has afflicted Greylimb the Ent.\n2\tBring the venom-glands to Erymeldir\tYou should bring the venom-glands you collected from the spiders of the Limlight Gorge to Erymeldir at the Limlight Glade.\n3\tTalk to Twistroot the Ent\tYou should ask Twistroot about spiders in Fangorn Forest.\n4\tTalk to Thickbark\tYou should ask Thickbark about spiders in Fangorn.\n",
[931]="7004EA8C\n1\tSpeak with Threkmóth\tYou should talk with Threkmóth, in Skoghús, and let him know you are prepared for the journey to Kêr Bréin.\n2\tTalk to Threkmóth\tYou should talk to Threkmóth back at Skoghús, the Thornholt.\n",
[932]="7006100C\n1\tTalk to Prisca Boffin inside 8 Honeymead Lane and attend her daughter's house-warming party\tPrisca Boffin is in 8 Honeymead Lane, and she is ready for the house-warming party to properly begin.\n2\tTalk to Bingo Boffin on Honeymead Lane\tBingo Boffin is outside Angelica's new home on Honeymead Lane.\n",
[933]="7006A9D2\n1\tFind the lost dog, Hírkha\tYou have been asked to stay on the look-out for a lost nether-hound as you travel through Ilmabiri.\n2\tIntroduce yourself to Hírkha\tYou have found Hírkha, a lost nether-hound as you travelled through Ilmabiri. You should introduce yourself to her.\n3\tLead Hírkha back to Lebíthi\tYou have found Hírkha, a lost nether-hound as you travelled through Ilmabiri. After introducing yourself to her, she seems willing to follow you. You should lead Hírkha to Kruha-sûrja, the guard post in the northern part of the sewers beneath the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tTalk to Lebíthi\tYou have found Hírkha, a lost nether-hound as you travelled through Ilmabiri and have led her to safety at the guard post Kruha-sûrja. You should talk to Lebíthi.\n",
[934]="70022922\n1\tCollect boar-meat for Mundo's next meal (total: 4)\tWild boars, perfect for pork or sausage, can be found roaming the outskirts of Archet. You should collect boar-meat for Mundo's next meal so that he doesn't waste away from starvation.\n2\tBring Mundo his lunch of fresh boar-meat\tMundo Sackville-Baggins awaits your return in the village of Archet. You should bring the boar-meat you collected to Mundo, who will probably eat it all. You only hope that it is enough to satisfy him.\n",
[935]="7006925E\n1\tMeet with Gûshida in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl\tMeet with Gûshida in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl about rumours relating to the mistreatment of animals.\n",
[936]="7006AAF9\n1\tDefeat Khabârkhad spiders (total: 12)\tNorth of Mekab-kuphâr there is an area infested with spiders. You've been asked to thin their number, lest they over-run Khabârkhad and spill out into greater Umbar-môkh.\n2\tReturn to the Temámir Guard Captain Nûru\tReturn to the Temámir Guard Captain Nûru in Mekab-kuphâr, the Temámir outpost in the southern Khabârkhad.\n",
[937]="70066A23\n1\tSearch the corpse\tHadorion has asked you to search the body and see if you can find what he could not.\n2\tTalk to Hadorion\tYou found traces of a green ichor on the victim's clothes. You should report to Hadorion. Hadorion can be found in Barad Faen.\n3\tTalk to the careful merchant\tHadorion has asked you to question the townsfolk of Barad Faen for more information on the mysterious ichor.\n4\tTalk to the anxious woman\tThe concerned merchant has told you the substance is foreign. You should question more townsfolk to see if they have noticed anything suspicious come through.\n5\tTalk to the distressed man\tThe woman has told you of someone new to town that seems distressed. You should search for them.\n6\tSearch the abandoned waggon\tThe man has told you that his waggon was hijacked before arriving in Barad Faen and abandoned along the western exit of Barad Faen.\n7\tTalk to Hadorion in Barad Faen\tYou found a shard of glass stained with the foul smelling ichor. You should return to Hadorion. Hadorion can be found in Barad Faen.\n8\tFollow Hadorion into the cabin\tHadorion wishes to speak to you in private, follow him into his hearth.\n",
[938]="700686A9\n1\tInvestigate the camp-site\tHadorion wants you to check on a new camp that has been erected to the north.\n2\tTalk to Hadorion in Barad Faen\tYou found a strange note with barely visible markings. Bring it back to Hadorion. Hadorion can be found in his cabin in Barad Faen.\n",
[939]="700686AD\n1\tSolve the case of the Vile Trail\tHadorion wants your help preventing the culprit from making an escape by sea.\n2\tTalk to Hadorion\tHadorion wants to speak to you about further options pursuing Khâshap. Hadorion can be found in his cabin in Barad Faen.\n",
[940]="700686AF\n1\tTalk to Hadorion\tHadorion wants your help preventing the culprit from making an escape by sea.\n2\tConfront Indagir\tFollow Hadorion in confronting the true culprit to solve the case.\n3\tTalk to Hadorion\tIndagir, or Khâshap has made their escape. Talk to Hadorion for further instructions.\n",
[941]="70066A25\n1\tFollow the trail left by the suspicious figure\tHadorion has asked you to pick up the trail of a suspicious figure spotted leaving Barad Faen at night. The trail should follow the western road.\n2\tFollow the trail left by the suspicious figure\tHadorion has asked you to pick up the trail of a suspicious figure spotted leaving Barad Faen at night. The trail should follow the western road.\n3\tFollow the trail left by the suspicious figure\tHadorion has asked you to pick up the trail of a suspicious figure spotted leaving Barad Faen at night. The trail should follow the western road.\n4\tFollow the trail left by the suspicious figure\tHadorion has asked you to pick up the trail of a suspicious figure spotted leaving Barad Faen at night. The trail should follow the western road.\n5\tFollow the trail left by the suspicious figure\tHadorion has asked you to pick up the trail of a suspicious figure spotted leaving Barad Faen at night. The trail should follow the western road.\n6\tFollow the trail into the tree line\tHadorion has asked you to pick up the trail of a suspicious figure spotted leaving Barad Faen at night. The trail should follow the western road.\n7\tSearch the camp-site\tThe trail has led you to an abandoned makeshift camp-site. Search for evidence of use.\n8\tTalk to Hadorion in Barad Faen\tThe interloper dropped a strange looking cloth that should be identifiable. You should report to Hadorion. Hadorion can be found in his home in Barad Faen.\n",
[942]="7000BFC5\n1\tTalk to Eimyr\030Collect Sword of Thrâng\tEimyr can be found within Norbar in The Rift of Nûrz Ghâshu. You have defeated Thrâng and hold his weapon as proof of your valour. You should go to Eimyr and tell him of the Ever-seer's evil betrayal.\n",
[943]="70034012\n1\tInvestigate the ice-spire\tYou have discovered a strange spire of ice and snow near the edge of the Isingmere, as if a terrible storm lingered in this one small spot.\n2\tGo north of the spire and look for signs\030Go east of the spire and look for signs\030Go south of the spire and look for signs\030Go west of the spire and look for signs\tThe snow will be less blinding to the north, south, east, and west of this ice-spire near the Isingmere lake in the south-east Whithsaws. You should start by walking north and look for signs of what caused this strange structure to appear on the plains. NOTE: This quest requires emotes.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have looked all around the ice spire for signs of what might have made it appear, and spied Núrzum's footprints heading westward. While it is clear that Núrzum left this strange mark upon the land, you saw no sign of any artifact or relic.\n",
[944]="70016B86\n1\tCollect pieces of Durin's Stone (total: 6)\tFragments of Durin's Stone can be found at Uruk-gashan, south of Mekhem-bizru. Haflith asked you to venture to Durin's Stone and collect the pieces the Orc-sappers had broken off.\n2\tBring the pieces of Durin's Stone to Haflith in Mekhem-bizru\tHaflith is in Mekhem-bizru, north-west of Uruk-gashan. Haflith will want to see the pieces of Durin's Stone which you collected.\n",
[945]="70060EA0\n1\tMeet up with Camellia Boffin and her siblings in Tighfield\tCamellia Boffin and her siblings should have reached Tighfield by now.\n2\tTalk to Camellia Boffin in Tighfield\tCamellia Boffin is in Tighfield, but some of her siblings have wandered off (as they often do).\n3\tMarigold might be getting into some trouble in Tham Amothir to the west, especially if there are half-orcs among the ruins.\t\n4\tMarigold might be getting into some trouble in Tham Amothir to the west, especially if there are half-orcs among the ruins.\t\n5\tTalk to Marigold Boffin near Tham Amothir\tMarigold Boffin is near the ruins of Tham Amothir.\n6\tFind Dinodas Boffin in Gamwich\tAccording to Marigold, her brother Dinodas intended to visit with a friend of his at Gamwich.\n7\tTalk to Dinodas Boffin in Gamwich\tDinodas Boffin is in Gamwich, and he is very pleased to see you.\n8\tMeet up with the Boffins back in Tighfield\tThe Boffin siblings plan to all meet back up at Tighfield, and would be happy for you to join them.\n9\tTalk to Bingo Boffin in Tighfield\tBingo is in Tighfield with some of his cousins (once removed).\n10\tTalk to Dinodas Boffin and see the house-warming present\tBingo is excited to see the house-warming present that Dinodas came up with.\n11\tExamine the painting of Angelica's new home\tDinodas arranged for an Elf-painter passing through the Shire to paint Angelica's new home.\n12\tTalk to Bingo Boffin in Tighfield\tBingo is very impressed with the painting Dinodas obtained for Angelica.\n",
[946]="7004350D\n1\tTalk to Lady Vanyalos in her hall on the north-east rise of Imloth Melui\tLady Vanyalos can be found in the great hall on the north-east rise of Imloth Melui. Merenir has asked you to pay a visit to Lady Vanyalos, insisting that somehow she dreamed of you.\n",
[947]="70028CA4\n1\tDefeat Wargs at their warren (total: 8)\tThe Warg-warren lies to the east from Garrun's camp. Garrun asked you to drive the Wargs from their warren in the Isendale.\n2\tTalk to Garrun in the Isendale\tGarrun's camp is west of the Warg-warren. You should return to Garrun with news of your success.\n",
[948]="7001AA7C\n1\tHead for the first milestone\tThe first milestone is along the road west of Emyn Lûm. Lomdognir laid out a specific route he needs you to take with the message you are carrying.\n2\tHead for the second milestone\tThe second milestone lies further along the road west of Emyn Lûm. Lomdognir laid out a specific route he needs you to take with the message you are carrying.\n3\tHead for the third milestone\tThe third milestone lies along the road where it turns north towards the abandoned village in Dourstocks. Lomdognir laid out a specific route he needs you to take with the message you are carrying.\n4\tTalk to Laeginn at the Haunted Inn\tLaeginn is stationed in the inn at Audaghaim in the Dourstocks. Lomdognir has instructed you to hand the message over to the Elf Laeginn.\n",
[949]="70067EE8\n1\tReturn the wood to Tankho in Rakhatâb\030Collect branches for the fires at Rakhatâb ([see journal]/8)\030Collect logs for the fires at Rakhatâb ([see journal]/10)\tTankho needs logs and branches collected from Jâghimsa, the forested area to the north and east of the fort of Rakhatâb.\n",
[950]="700604B5\n1\tDefeat craban spies (total: 12)\tCariad has suggested clearing craban spies from the wilderness north-east of the Cuan-lûth refuge.\n2\tTalk to Cariad\tCariad is waiting for you at the entrance of the Cuan-lûth refuge. You should talk to him there.\n",
[951]="70044E22\n1\tTalk to Tawaris\tThe soldiers Gradir and Tawaris can be found on the northern side of the Second Circle. Talk to Tawaris to hear his side of the argument.\n2\tTalk to Gradir\tThe soldiers Gradir and Tawaris can be found on the northern side of the Second Circle. Talk to Gradir to hear his side of the argument.\n3\tCarry the chicken to the Ship's Prow\tGradir said chickens could be found in the Court of Eärnil. The Ship's Prow lies at the very top of Minas Tirith, jutting out of the Citadel. Find a chicken and drop it off of the Ship's Prow to determine whether Gradir or Tawaris is right.\n4\tFind out what happened to the chicken\tYou should check the First Circle below the Ship's Prow to see what became of the chicken.\n5\tReturn to Gradir and Tawaris\tThe soldiers can be found on the northern side of the Second Circle. You should return to Gradir and Tawaris and tell them what happened with the chicken.\n",
[952]="70044E3A\n1\tTalk to Tawaris\tThe soldiers Gradir and Tawaris can be found on the northern side of the Second Circle. Hear what Tawaris has to say.\n2\tTalk to Gradir\tThe soldiers Gradir and Tawaris can be found on the northern side of the Second Circle. Hear what Gradir has to say.\n3\tCollect dregs from ale (total: 3)\030Collect brazier ash (total: 2)\030Collect Healer's Caustic\tYou should bring Gradir the items he needs to make rotgut: ale dregs from the Splintered Shield, hot brazier ash, and Healer's Caustic. All three ingredients can be found on the Second Circle: the dregs in the southern section, the brazier ash in the northern section, and Healer's Caustic at any healer's stall.\n4\tReturn to Gradir\tGradir and Tawaris can be found on the northern side of the Second Circle. You should return to Gradir with the rotgut ingredients.\n5\tDrink the rotgut\tYou should drink the rotgut that Gradir prepared for you.\n6\tTalk to Tawaris\tGradir and Tawaris can be found on the northern side of the Second Circle. Hear what Tawaris has to say.\n7\tTap the left archer on the shoulder\030Walk between the last two ranks of men\030Wave to Gradir and Tawaris\030Climb on top of the barrel\tStanding after a drink of rotgut is not enough for Tawaris. He wants to see you tap the left-hand archer on the shoulder to compliment his aim, walk between the last two ranks of soldiers to his right, and then stand on the barrels and give a wave.\n8\tReturn to Gradir\tThe soldiers can be found on the northern side of the Second Circle. You should return to Gradir and Tawaris so they can settle their bet.\n",
[953]="7002710A\n1\tTalk to Guard Ambras at the western guardpost\030Talk to Guard Cai at the eastern guardpost\030Talk to Guard Edrud at the southern guardpost\tThere are three guardposts throughout the Pristine Glade. Maugan has asked you to go and check at each guardpost for any signs of Saruman's forces.\n2\tTalk to Maugan at the Tree\tMaugan awaits you at the Tree. You should return immediately to Maugan and let him know that Saruman is attacking the Glade.\n",
[954]="70015E3C\n1\tFind Bill the Pony\tBill the Pony was last seen in Torech Andraug, west of Echad Dúnann. Glavroleth has asked that you find Bill the Pony and clear a path to safety.\n",
[955]="70044E69\n1\tTalk to Dúrbethir\tTalk to Dúrbethir in the Fourth Circle and ask how you can help him compose a war poem.\n2\tListen to the soldiers training\030Find a cold knife\030Find a sweaty rag\tSoldiers can be found training and making ready in the Second Circle. Dúrbethir asked that you go among the soldiers and listen to them train, as well as retrieve a cold knife and a sweaty rag.\n3\tFind pieces of charred wood (total: 3)\030Find trampled wheat (total: 3)\030Hear the death-rattle of enemy soldiers (total: 4)\030Observe the gleam in the eyes of a captain\tPillaged farmsteads and the enemy army can be found across the Pelennor, outside Minas Tirith. Dúrbethir asked that you find ruined farmsteads and gather charred wood and trampled wheat. He also asked that you hear for him the death-rattle of enemy soldiers and see the gleam in an enemy captain's eye in combat and defeat.\n4\tReturn to Dúrbethir\tReturn to Dúrbethir in the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\n",
[956]="70017928\n1\tBring the collected items to Hrotha at Ost Guruth in the Lone-lands\030Collect hoary aurochs hides (total: 6)\030Collect Redtusk's hide\tHoary aurochs are said to roam in the Misty Mountains. Redtusk is said to forage near Torech Braignel in north-east Eregion. Hrotha requires the hides of hoary aurochs and the pelt of the great boar known as Redtusk.\n2\tBring the collected items to Hrotha at Ost Guruth in the Lone-lands\030Collect barbed barghest tails (total: 10)\030Collect coiled spider spinnerets (total: 20)\tBarghests can be found in Imlad Balchorth in Angmar. The spiders can be found throughout Angmar. Hrotha requires the tails of barghests and the spinnerets of spiders to continue.\n3\tBring the collected items to Hrotha at Ost Guruth in the Lone-lands\030Collect a Rune of Evil Presence\030Collect the teeth of the Gorthorog\tSálvakh dwells in Carn Dûm in Angmar. Dushkâl, Brízrip, and Thordragh can be found at Urugarth in Angmar. Hrotha needs the third and final set of items to complete his task.\n",
[957]="70061D32\n1\tDefeat the Warg at the Howlingstones\tThere is a Warg at Howlingstones. Find and defeat the Warg.\n2\tFollow the tracks south\tTrack the Warg deeper into the Howlingstones\n3\tInspect the slain deer and prepare for a fight\t\n4\tTalk to Cledd\tCledd can be found near the eastern gate of Mossward. Talk to Cledd.\n",
[958]="700304B1\n1\tFind the rider's trail\tFastred has reported that the rider was last seen along the road to the east.\n2\tInspect the fallen Rohirrim rider\tYou have come across the remains of a rider and his steed. You should examine his body and see if you cannot glean more information about what has occurred here.\n3\tTalk to Cynelac\tCynelac can be found outside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn. Having discovered a slain Rohirrim outside Snowbourn bearing the garb of Walstow, you have deduced that a great siege will soon befall the town.\n",
[959]="7006000E\n1\tBurn supplies at Tâg Fógarrach (total: 10)\030Pick up a torch to burn supplies\tTâg Fógarrach can be found in western Câr Bronach. You should burn supplies at Tâg Fógarrach. Note: Torches can be dropped by right clicking the induction bar.\n2\tTalk to Monathár\tEiricháv can be found in north west Câr Bronach. You should talk to Monathár.\n",
[960]="70041784\n1\tSpeak with Thandor\tThandor, the Gondorian Captain, can be located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani. You should speak with Thandor.\n2\tLocate the rescue boat near the docks\030Rescue Siriel\030Rescue Lorvegil\030Rescue Celebros\tThe Corsair ships can be reached using the boat to the south of the Gondorian Captain. You should board the Corsair ships and rescue the captured nobles.\n3\tTalk to Thandor\tThandor, the Gondorian Captain, can be located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani. You should speak with Thandor.\n",
})
